# Default build after changes

When finishing a code change in this repo (client, server, styles, or shared utils):

1. Run `bun run build` before considering the task done, unless the user explicitly says not to.
2. Do not wait for the user to ask "build".
3. If only docs/tests/comments changed and nothing affects `dist/`, skip build and say so briefly.
4. After build, a one-line confirmation is enough (no need to paste the full build log).
